{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54185","headline":"望故沔城 · 皮日休","name":"望故沔城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江城遗壤在，舣棹望天涯。\n古壁昭丘树，残红梦苑花。\n楼台依水势，雉堞带山斜。\n何事堪挥泪，乡程北去賖。\n（见民国十年刊《湖北通志》卷一○一《金石》九录《鄂州杂诗碑》引）（按：《鄂州杂诗碑》分五层，录谢朓及唐人诗三十九首，题「熙宁二年六月□日额立」。\n不着书人姓名。\n清时尚存黄鹤楼後斗姥阁西壁。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}